abstract: >-
  An independent savings tracker for Maryland's Government Modernization
  Initiative (GMI). A free, local pipeline (SODA API -> Parquet -> DuckDB ->
  dashboard CSVs) checks reported savings against the state's own payments,
  budgets, staffing and grants data, and quantifies the path to the state's
  $50M annual savings target. Includes LightGBM quantile forecast corridors,
  an isolation-forest anomaly review queue, spending-mix agency clustering,
  and grant-text program families. Not an official State of Maryland product.
